# The silver thread on death (#341, D81; the image of #228): one sheet, two parts, no frame animation.
# Column 0, rows 0-1: the strand, stamped once per pixel along the computed curve between Edgard's wrist and the
# room start: silver over an ink underside (D76 active tier; the D78 dialogue silvers measured 0.10 on the old forest sky).
# Columns 1-5: the glint, the D78 dialogue star, that runs from the start to the wrist as the thread goes taut.
size 6 5
color S d8dee9
color I 0b0d18
color W ffffff
frame thread
S..S..
I.SWS.
.SWWWS
..SWS.
...S..
